# The corpora carry licences. mngu0 is distributed on the condition that it is not passed on, and
# MOCHA's licence is non-commercial. Nothing measured goes in the repository — only what was fitted
# from it, which is the same split lab/RECORDING.md already uses for the reference recording.
data/*
!data/README.md

# The environment is reproducible from requirements.txt; the tree of wheels is not worth versioning.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Generated tracks. Tens of megabytes per corpus pass, and derived by definition.
out/
*.csv
